# Testing

- Use Jest. Do not add Vitest tests.
- Cover the cases named in the feature file and `docs/engineering/TESTING_STRATEGY.md`.
- Integration tests use the configured PostgreSQL and Redis. Do not skip them silently.
- Do not mark a feature Verified unless this run passed and the progress log records the command and result.
